<title>MEXICO: Latam steel product exports by country -ILAFA.</title>
<headline>Latam steel product exports by country -ILAFA.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latin American Insitute of Iron and Steel (ILAFA) outlined here at the Latin American Steel Congress exports of semi-finished and finished steel products by country in the region. A table follows with a breakdown in 1000s of tonnes. The figure for 1996 is preliminary.</p>
<p>  Country	 1994     1995     1996   %Chnge 96/95</p>
<p>  Argentina	 925    1,360    1,343     -1.3</p>
<p>  Brazil	 11,078    9,655   10,257	6.2</p>
<p>  Chile		61	 74	126     70.8</p>
<p>  Colombia	    4	 12	 13	N/A</p>
<p>  Mexico	  2,442    5,747    5,747	0.0</p>
<p>  Venezuela     1,029    1,103    1,741     57.8</p>
<p>  Others	    450	500	525	5.0</p>
<p>  Total	  16,766   18,451   19,753	7.1</p>
<p>--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289530</p>
